    ["Accept it and use its power to strike down our mutual enemies.Know that around your neck you carry a piece of history."] = "收下它，用它的力量击倒我们共同的敌人。要知道，你颈间挂着的是一段历史。",
    ["Kezan was once a grand territory of the Zandalar Empire."] = "科赞曾是赞达拉帝国的一大片疆土。",
    ["Alas, the taint of goblin trade princes would force out my proud brothers and sisters.Kezan is now home to the goblin capital of the Undermine; but know that before the taint, it held greatness."] = "可叹，地精贸易亲王的污秽赶走了我骄傲的兄弟姐妹。科赞如今是地精首都安德麦的所在；但你要知道，污秽到来之前，这里曾有过伟大。",
    ["Still to this day Kezan is considered sacred land to my people."] = "直到今天，科赞在我的族人眼里仍是圣地。",
    ["ProgressCall forth your demons, &lt;class&gt;."] = "召出你的恶魔，<class>。",
    ["Let them bask in the energy of Kezan's Taint."] = "让他们沐浴在科赞的玷污的能量里。",
    ["Command them on the field of battle!"] = "在战场上指挥他们！",
    ["Decimate the enemy!Yes..."] = "屠灭敌人！是的……",
    ["The time has come to apply the final enhancement to Kezan's Taint."] = "是时候给科赞的玷污加上最后一层强化了。",
    ["Give me the talisman."] = "把护符给我。",
    ["Here's your armor, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Furen's process worked brilliantly! &nbsp;Perfectly! &nbsp;Marvelously, truly!You could run this armor over with a siege engine and it would spring right back into shape!"] = "这是你的护甲，<name>。&nbsp;弗伦的工艺出色极了！&nbsp;完美！&nbsp;奇妙，真的！就算用攻城器械从这副护甲上碾过去，它也会立刻弹回原形！",
    ["ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike."] = "站在我面前的是一位联盟的崇拜英雄。<哈格丁中尉敬礼。>雷矛之中很少有人赢得这样的军阶。",
    ["I have watched the enemy fall before you."] = "我看见敌人倒在你面前。",
    ["I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence."] = "我看见他们的决心在你面前崩溃。",
    ["When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia."] = "当你投入混战，你就成了我们部队的希望灯塔！呈上你的徽记。",
    ["ProgressAn extremely sturdy cabinet stands before you, securely fastened shut by a built-in lock. &nbsp;The front of the cabinet is deeply scratched and marked. &nbsp;This could be surmised as being from numerous and violent failed attempts to reveal whatever secrets the cabinet currently obfuscates from view.If you are going to open this cabinet, you will need to find the key."] = "一座极其结实的柜子立在你面前，内置的锁把它牢牢扣死。&nbsp;柜子正面伤痕累累。&nbsp;可以想见，那是一次次猛烈却失败的尝试，想揭开柜子此刻藏起的秘密。若要打开这柜子，你得找到钥匙。",
    ["ProgressMolthor delivers word from King Rastakhan, &lt;name&gt;."] = "莫托尔带来了拉斯塔哈大王的口信，<name>。",
    ["The royal court is most impressed with your decimation of the Hakkari forces."] = "王庭对你屠灭哈卡莱部队一事印象极深。",
    ["I am to award you with the final weave in your talisman."] = "我要为你的护符授予最后一道编织。",
    ["Hand it to me."] = "把它交给我。",
    ["Rituals of Power sends you into Scarlet Monastery Library."] = "能量仪祭会把你送进血色修道院图书馆。",
    ["Bring Bink her Mage-tastic Gizmonitor."] = "把彬克的法师文档存储器带给她。",
    ["Here is your robe. &nbsp;It's one of my best made yet! &nbsp;Wear it with pride, and when people ask... tell them you got it at the Larson Clothiers!"] = "这是你的长袍。&nbsp;这是我至今做得最好的一件！&nbsp;骄傲地穿上它，要是有人问……就说你是在拉尔森服装店做的！",
    ["I have finished with your piece of armor, and I am quite pleased. &nbsp;Furen's new techniques meshed perfectly with my own and I am sure this armor will prove to be quite resilient.Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;And may this serve you well in future battles."] = "你的那件护甲我做完了，我相当满意。&nbsp;弗伦的新技术和我自己的手法配合得天衣无缝，我确信这副护甲会非常坚韧。谢谢你，<name>。&nbsp;愿它在今后的战斗里好好为你效力。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!"] = "<name>，你成功地改造了那些坩埚，这对我们是一场巨大的胜利！让在场的所有人都听见：为了被遗忘者和整个部落，你做出了远超期望的贡献——我还要说，那是在压倒性的劣势和难以置信的危险面前——我把这个交给<name>，并以部落真正英雄的名义，向他致以我们不尽的感激。&nbsp;万岁！",
    ["Here is your nether-lace, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;It is both comfortable and durable, and holds the magic of the laughing sisters' hair.Enjoy, and if you find it amenable, please mention so to Deino. &nbsp;She is a &lt;class&gt; on whose good side I wish to stay..."] = "这是你的虚空花边，<name>。&nbsp;它既舒适又耐用，还留着欢笑姐妹头发里的魔法。好好享用，要是你觉得合意，请向迪诺提一句。&nbsp;她是一位我想一直讨好的<class>……",
    ["Now isn't this interesting?"] = "这不是挺有意思吗？",
    ["You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;?"] = "你说这块石板是在辛特兰望海崖一座荒芜的小岛上找到的，<class>？",
    ["Very interesting indeed."] = "确实非常有意思。",
    ["I thank you for your efforts in this matter."] = "感谢你在这件事上的努力。",
    ["Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery."] = "我们的黑暗女王会对这个发现非常高兴。",
    ["Here, allow me to reward you proportionately."] = "来，请允许我按你的功劳奖赏你。",
    ["Erlgadin in Stranglethorn Vale."] = "荆棘谷的 Erlgadin。",
    ["Progress*Whir* *Click* &nbsp;I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. &nbsp; If you bring me a Keefer's Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. *Zzzap* *Whir*."] = "*嗡* *咔哒* &nbsp;我在为 Fishmaster Bluegill 收集稀有的鱼好编目。&nbsp; 如果你给我一条基佛天使鱼，我就给你这份不错的报酬。*滋滋* *嗡*。",
    ["Find what awaits you."] = "去找等待着你的东西。",
    ["It will take time for our scholars to study the pendant you brought us. &nbsp;But for your service to the Horde I would like to offer you a small token.Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Your acts bring honor to you, and to us."] = "学者们研究你带来的坠饰需要时间。&nbsp;但为了你对部落的效劳，我想送你一件小纪念品。谢谢你，<name>。&nbsp;你的所作所为给你、也给我们带来荣耀。",
    ["Return the monogrammed silver hair clip to its owner."] = "把刻著名字缩写的银发卡还给它的主人。",
    ["Here are your robes, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Wear them well."] = "这是你的长袍，<name>。&nbsp;好好地穿上。",
    ["ProgressIt is good to see you in good health, &lt;name&gt;."] = "看到你身体健康，真好，<name>。",
    ["The glorious battles you have undertaken affect all life on this planet."] = "你进行的那些光荣战斗影响着这颗星球上的一切生命。",
    ["Hakkar must never leave the confines of Zul'Gurub as the world will surely collapse beneath his immense hunger.Give me your talisman and I shall amplify its strength."] = "哈卡绝不能离开祖尔格拉布，否则世界必将在他无尽的饥饿下崩塌。把护符给我，我会增强它的力量。",
    ["Use the Strength of Mugamba to punish our enemies!"] = "用穆贾巴之力惩罚我们的敌人！",
    ["ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises."] = "德雷克塔尔在称颂你。",
    ["Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics."] = "卡利姆多到处都在传颂你的英雄事迹。",
    ["The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;."] = "酋长容光焕发——你对我们氏族坚定的防守让他非常高兴。你赢得了命令之眼。呈上你的徽记，指挥官<name>。",
    ["ProgressTales of your battles against the Gurubashi are whispered in the winds, &lt;class&gt;."] = "你与古拉巴什交战的故事在风中低语，<class>。",
    ["Even royalty is beginning to talk of your deeds."] = "连王室都开始谈论你的事迹。",
    ["It is rumored that King Rastakhan even mentioned you by name.The time has come to imbue the Eye."] = "传闻拉斯塔哈大王甚至点了你的名。是时候为这只眼注入力量了。",
    ["Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the service."] = "把护符交给我，我来完成这项仪式。",
    ["ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity!"] = "我从未见过这样的坚韧！",
    ["The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment."] = "青铜龙军团赐予你最后一次附魔。",
    ["The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments."] = "永恒者本人如此要求！把你的玺戒给我，我来做必要的调整。",
    ["Know this, heathen: A catastrophe has brought us together."] = "记住，异教徒：一场灾祸把我们聚到了一起。",
    ["Your pagan ways are neither understood nor appreciated by Zandalar but we are a fair people."] = "赞达拉既不理解也不欣赏你的异教方式，但我们是公正的人民。",
    ["Wear this brand around your neck."] = "把这枚烙印戴在颈上。",
    ["It shall serve as both a warning to our enemies and a symbol of your friendship to Zandalar.Continue to serve our people and I will amplify the power of the brand."] = "它既是对敌人的警告，也是你与赞达拉友谊的象征。继续为我们的人民效力，我会增强这枚烙印的力量。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, you have slain all three beasts that comprise the Ashenvale Hunt. &nbsp;You have brought me adequate proof of their demise; there is no question of your strength and tenacity. &nbsp;The blood of a hunter streaks through your veins, and you should be commended!Please, accept this bauble as a sign of congratulations on your mighty deeds done in Ashenvale for the Horde today. &nbsp;May your ancestors watch over you!"] = "<name>，你杀死了组成灰谷狩猎的三头野兽。&nbsp;你带来了它们死亡的充分证据；你的力量与坚韧无可置疑。&nbsp;猎人的血在你血管里奔流，你应当受到称赞！请收下这件小饰物，作为今天你在灰谷为部落立下伟绩的祝贺。&nbsp;愿你的祖先看护着你！",
    ["ProgressAh, &lt;name&gt;, it is good to smell you again.You'll have to excuse my sense of humor."] = "啊，<name>，再次闻到你真好。你得原谅我的幽默感。",
    ["It can be most foul at times.I sense that you have caused great anguish to our enemies."] = "有时候它会非常难闻。我感觉到你给我们的敌人造成了巨大的痛苦。",
    ["The forces of Hakkar cry out your name in anger."] = "哈卡的部队愤怒地呼喊你的名字。",
    ["This is most excellent.You have earned another weave on your talisman."] = "这非常出色。你的护符又赢得了一道编织。",
    ["ProgressKing Rastakhan sends his regards, Master &lt;name&gt;."] = "拉斯塔哈大王向你致意，大师<name>。",
    ["Such an honor has never been given to one outside the Zandalar tribe.Give me your talisman so that I may enhance it once more."] = "这样的荣誉从未给予赞达拉部族以外的人。把护符给我，我再增强它一次。",
    ["Know that the Rage of Mugamba is now intrinsically connected to your very soul."] = "要知道，穆贾巴之怒如今已与你的灵魂本身相连。",
    ["Greetings, champion."] = "问候你，勇士。",
    ["I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove."] = "我是 Jonathan，圣锣的保管者，青铜龙军团的永恒看守。永恒者本人授权我，从他超越时间的宝库里赐给你一件自选的物品。",
    ["May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun."] = "愿它在你对抗克苏恩的战斗中助你一臂之力。",
    ["Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines."] = "帮助 Walton 在与泰瑞·长饮和库尔提拉斯水兵的遭遇中活下来。",
    ["Deathstalker Masoj needs you to place the three Apothecary Vials on peaks around Hillsbrad Foothills and return to him."] = "亡灵哨兵 Masoj 需要你把三支 Apothecary Vial 放到希尔斯布莱德丘陵四周的山峰上，然后回到他那里。",
    ["ProgressSha-mon!"] = "萨满！",
    ["Maywiki make a joke!&lt;Maywiki laughs.&gt;So, you been using the spirits and elements against our enemies in Zul'Gurub, eh?"] = "Maywiki 开玩笑啦！<Maywiki 笑了。>所以你一直在用灵魂和元素对付祖尔格拉布的敌人，是吧？",
    ["Spirits be praised!Maywiki gonna brighten your orb."] = "赞美灵魂！Maywiki 要让你的宝珠亮起来。",
    ["Give it here, &lt;name&gt;."] = "拿到这儿来，<name>。",
    ["Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post."] = "杀死阿纳克·恐怖图腾，把你的证物交给乱风岗的峭壁卫兵图林·长角。",
    ["Reward from the quest 'Wanted!"] = "任务「Wanted!的奖励",
    ["Marez Cowl'."] = "玛雷兹·考尔'。",
    ["Otto and Falconcrest'."] = "奥图和法库雷斯特'。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure."] = "<name>，我用你带来的艾露尼特打造了这些武器。&nbsp;请拿走最适合你的那一件。我也必须谢谢你。&nbsp;以艾露尼特做工既是荣誉，也是乐事。",
    ["I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.Choose your weapon, &lt;name&gt;, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian."] = "我有旋风之心，准备把它放进你选定的容器。选择你的武器，<name>，要知道它的力量就是 Cyclonian 的力量。",
    ["ProgressIt yearns to grow, &lt;name&gt;."] = "它渴望成长，<name>。",
    ["The talisman has soaked in all that you have done."] = "护符已经浸透了你所做的一切。",
    ["The thousands of troll corpses littering Zul'Gurub have fueled its power."] = "遍布祖尔格拉布的成千上万具巨魔尸体助长了它的力量。",
    ["Hand it to me and I shall make the final enhancement."] = "把它交给我，我来做最后的强化。",
    ["ProgressImpressive, &lt;name&gt;."] = "令人印象深刻，<name>。",
    ["You have a gift for killing that I have not sensed in another in many years."] = "你有一种杀戮的天赋，许多年来我在别人身上都没有感觉到。",
    ["Even Molthor is aware of the work that you have done for Zandalar."] = "连莫托尔都知道你为赞达拉所做的事。",
    ["It is time to enhance your talisman further."] = "是时候进一步增强你的护符了。",
    ["Give it to me."] = "把它给我。",
    ["A Gnomeregan oddity whose Use effect grants a huge burst of attack speed."] = "一件诺莫瑞根的奇物，其使用效果会大幅爆发攻击速度。",
    ["Feral druids kept it for that alone, because it works in cat form -- and it has limited charges, so every use is a decision."] = "野性德鲁伊只为这一点留着它，因为它在猎豹形态下也能用——而且充能有限，每一次使用都是一次抉择。",
    ["A Nightmare-corrupted green dragon who splits himself into shades rather than face a fight whole."] = "一条被梦魇腐蚀的绿龙，他宁可把自己分成几个幻影，也不愿以完整之身迎战。",
    ["A blue dragon slain in Northrend and raised as a frost wyrm."] = "一条在诺森德被杀死、又被复活为冰霜巨龙的蓝龙。",
    ["He guards the final approach to Kel'Thuzad's chamber."] = "他守卫着通往克尔苏加德大厅的最后一段路。",
    ["A bounty has been placed on the head of Marez Cowl, a high-level advisor and operative of the Syndicate."] = "辛迪加的高级顾问和特工玛雷兹·考尔已被悬赏。",
    ["She was last seen within the Syndicate controlled territory of Stromgarde."] = "最后一次见到她，是在辛迪加控制的激流堡领地。",
    ["A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."] = "一条深火中的熔火恶犬，被当作守卫的野兽，由拉格纳罗斯的副官喂养。",
    ["A crafted helm that outlived several tiers of raid gear."] = "一顶打造出来的头盔，比好几档团队装备都活得更久。",
    ["Its plans were the thing guilds actually fought over."] = "公会真正争抢的，是它的图纸。",
    ["A crypt lord of Azjol-Nerub who took Arthas's side."] = "一位站到阿尔萨斯一边的艾卓-尼鲁布地穴领主。",
    ["He holds the Arachnid Quarter's outermost hall."] = "他占据着蜘蛛区最外侧的大厅。",
    ["A death knight who trains the Scourge's new officers."] = "一位训练天灾新军官的死亡骑士。",
    ["He is too strong for his own students to touch, which is exactly the point of the lesson."] = "他强到自己的学生都碰不着他，而这正是这一课的意义。",
    ["A fungal horror grown in the Plague Quarter's spore vats -- less a creature than a crop that got out of hand."] = "在瘟疫区的孢子缸里长出来的真菌恐魔——与其说是生物，不如说是一茬失控的作物。",
    ["A giant spider webbed into the depths of the Arachnid Quarter, fed on whatever the Scourge no longer needs."] = "一只在蜘蛛区深处结网的巨蛛，吃的是天灾不再需要的一切。",
    ["A green dragon of Ysera's flight, turned by the Nightmare and hunted across Feralas ever since."] = "伊瑟拉龙军团的一条绿龙，被梦魇扭转，此后一直在菲拉斯被追捕。",
    ["A hound handler of Ragnaros's court, who curses healing shut before the fighting starts."] = "拉格纳罗斯宫廷的驯犬人，在开战之前就用诅咒封死治疗。",
    ["A human lord who traded his life for undeath and became a lich in Scholomance."] = "一位用生命换取不死、在通灵学院成为巫妖的人类领主。",
    ["Killing him takes a blade specifically made to sever the bargain."] = "杀死他需要一把专门用来斩断这笔交易的剑。",
    ["A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."] = "拉格纳罗斯的一位副官，在火誓者的环绕中作战，每倒下一名火誓者他就更强一分。",
    ["A living mass of qiraji poison."] = "一团活着的其拉毒药。",
    ["It has to be frozen solid and then shattered, which is not how most things die."] = "必须先把它冻实，再击碎，这不是大多数东西死去的方式。",
    ["A necromancer of the Plague Quarter, promoted for his skill at raising what he had just finished killing."] = "瘟疫区的一位死灵法师，因擅长复活自己刚刚杀死的东西而得到提拔。",
    ["A pit lord left behind when the Legion's invasion collapsed, still holding the Tainted Scar where the Dark Portal's blast burned the land."] = "军团入侵崩溃时留下的一位深渊领主，仍占据着黑暗之门的爆炸烧焦大地的腐烂之痕。",
    ["A plain plate glove that became famous for its random enchants -- the of Strength roll is a 7.9% chance and was worth chasing over guaranteed epics for years."] = "一副普通的板甲手套，因随机附魔而出名——力量后缀的几率是7.9%，多年来比保底的史诗更值得去追。",
    ["A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."] = "土元素的公主，也是玛拉顿中毒的原因——她把半神配偶 Zaetar 的遗体留在洞穴的中心。",
    ["A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."] = "一位其拉虫巢主母，她的毒烈到这场战斗其实是在和她的毒液赛跑。",
    ["A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments."] = "阿莱克丝塔萨龙军团的一条红龙，被奈法利安的实验折断了。",
    ["He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."] = "他请求在腐蚀彻底夺走他之前杀死他，并且一边战斗一边道歉。",
    ["A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."] = "一条在沙漠下长到巨大的沙虫，只在进食时钻出地面。",
    ["A stitched hound kept half-starved on purpose, so it would eat anything the Construct Quarter sent its way."] = "一条故意养得半饥的缝合犬，好让它吃下构造区送来的任何东西。",
    ["A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."] = "一个被强迫为其拉效力的石巨人，他吸干所有与他交战者的法力，吸满之后化为岩石。",
    ["A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."] = "一只巨大的其拉掘地虫，战斗中产下幼虫，并把入侵者甩到墙上。",
    ["A worshipper of Kel'Thuzad who brought her followers with her into undeath, and still commands them."] = "克尔苏加德的一位崇拜者，她把追随者一起带进了不死，并且仍在指挥他们。",
    ["An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed."] = "一位上古之神，泰坦没有杀死他，而是把他埋在安其拉之下。",
    ["It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."] = "从那以后它一直在对其拉低语，整场战争之所以存在，是因为它从未停下。",
    ["An abomination stitched together from the Scourge's leftovers, built for nothing but raw strength."] = "一具用天灾的边角料缝起来的憎恶，造出来只为了蛮力。",
    ["Archmage Arugal called the worgen to Silverpine to defend against the Scourge, lost control of them immediately, and went mad in Shadowfang Keep among the things he had summoned."] = "大法师阿鲁高把狼人召到银松森林抵御天灾，随即失去控制，并在影牙城堡里、在他自己召唤的东西中间疯了。",
    ["Arugal's own belt."] = "阿鲁高自己的腰带。",
    ["He summoned the worgen to save Silverpine, then lost his mind in Shadowfang Keep surrounded by what he had called."] = "他召唤狼人来拯救银松森林，然后在影牙城堡里被自己召来的东西包围，失去了理智。",
    ["Avast Lubber!"] = "喂，旱鸭子！",
    ["Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!"] = "给我拿来12件竞技场大师的饰品，你就能成为古拉巴什竞技场的大宗师！",
    ["C'Thun's mouthpiece."] = "克苏恩的喉舌。",
    ["Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."] = "其拉相信的一切，都是因为他对他们说，上古之神是这么讲的。",
    ["Cut from the fang of one of Nefarian's drakes."] = "从奈法利安一条幼龙的尖牙上切下来的。",
    ["Tanks wore it for the stun it shrugs off, not the numbers on it."] = "坦克穿它，是为了它能甩掉的那次昏迷，不是为了上面的数字。",
    ["Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five."] = "死亡之翼之子，在黑石山下培育多彩龙军团——带着全部五个龙军团之血的龙。",
    ["He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."] = "工作进行的那些年里，他以维克多·奈法里奥斯领主的身份待在暴风城的宫廷。",
    ["Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."] = "加摩拉是纳迦养在黑暗深渊的古龟——老到那里的暮光教徒把它当成神殿的一部分。",
    ["Hakkar's chief hexxer, who fights by binding pieces of his enemies' spirits and setting them loose."] = "哈卡的首席妖术师，他的打法是绑住敌人灵魂的碎片，再把它们放出去。",
    ["He has overpowered all attempts at his capture."] = "所有捉拿他的尝试都被他压了下去。",
    ["The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "暴风城军队为这只豺狼人悬了丰厚的赏金。",
    ["Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf."] = "可你已经证明自己是霜狼勇敢而光荣的士兵。",
    ["Keeper of Naxxramas's plague works, and of the corridor of eruptions that has killed more raiders than he has."] = "纳克萨玛斯瘟疫工坊的看守，也是那条喷发走廊的看守，那条走廊杀死的团队成员比他还多。",
    ["Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."] = "奈法利安最好的成果：一头双头的多彩恐魔，同时带着每一支龙军团的吐息。",
    ["Once an archmage of the Kirin Tor, he left Dalaran to found the Cult of the Damned and served Ner'zhul willingly."] = "他曾是肯瑞托的大法师，离开达拉然创立了诅咒神教，并甘愿侍奉耐奥祖。",
    ["Killed at Andorhal and raised as a lich, he rules Naxxramas from a phylactery at its heart."] = "他在安多哈尔被杀，又被复活为巫妖，从位于中心的护命匣统治着纳克萨玛斯。",
    ["One of Hakkar's high priests, who returns to his feet twice before he stays down."] = "哈卡的一位高阶祭司，他会重新站起来两次，然后才肯倒下。",
    ["One of Nefarian's three guardian drakes, holding the suspended walkways above the lair floor."] = "奈法利安三条守卫幼龙之一，占据着巢穴地面上方的悬空步道。",
    ["One of Ysera's four green consorts, corrupted by the Emerald Nightmare and now roaming Feralas, rotting the ground it stands on."] = "伊瑟拉四位绿色配偶之一，被翡翠梦魇腐蚀，如今在菲拉斯游荡，站过的土地都会腐烂。",
    ["One of the three qiraji councillors who fight as one -- kill any of them and the survivors grow stronger."] = "三位如同一人作战的其拉议员之一——杀死其中任何一个，活下来的就会变得更强。",
    ["One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."] = "守卫奈法利安内巢的三条幼龙之一，也是靠自己造成的伤口来治疗自己的那一条。",
    ["One of three weapons from the same solitary warrior trial."] = "同一场独行战士试炼中的三件武器之一。",
    ["Choosing it means giving up the axe and the staff for good."] = "选择它，就意味着永远放弃那把斧和那根杖。",
    ["Ragnaros wielded this hammer as the Firelord."] = "拉格纳罗斯以炎魔之身挥舞过这把战锤。",
    ["Reforging it means taking the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros himself and setting it into the Sulfuron Hammer."] = "重铸它，意味着从拉格纳罗斯本人那里取下萨弗拉斯之眼，嵌进萨弗隆战锤。",
    ["Razuvious's colleague in the Military Quarter, who fights from behind his own dead and keeps sending them forward."] = "军事区里拉苏维奥斯的同僚，他躲在自己的死者身后作战，并不断把他们派上前。",
    ["Revelosh was a Shadowforge explorer who went into Uldaman looking for the origin of the dwarves, and became part of the ruin instead."] = "鲁维罗什是一位暗炉探险者，他进入奥达曼寻找矮人的起源，结果自己成了废墟的一部分。",
    ["Rise and be honored!"] = "起来，接受荣耀！",
    ["Present your insignia."] = "呈上你的徽记。",
    ["Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."] = "Serra'kis 是纳迦在黑暗深渊被淹没的厅堂里培育的巨大水兽，也是下层神殿之所以沉在水下的原因。",
    ["Son of Blackhand and the last warchief of the Dark Horde, still holding Blackrock Spire long after the rest of the Horde moved on."] = "黑手之子，黑暗部落的末代酋长，在部落其余人离开很久之后仍占据着黑石塔。",
    ["Teebu's blade sets things on fire for reasons no one has ever explained."] = "提布的剑会把东西点着，原因从来没有人解释过。",
    ["It is famous for being almost useless and deeply desirable at the same time."] = "它出名，是因为几乎没用，同时又让人非常想要。",
    ["The Druids of the Fang broke from Cenarius and let the Emerald Nightmare into the Wailing Caverns."] = "尖牙德鲁伊背离了塞纳留斯，把翡翠梦魇放进了哀嚎洞穴。",
    ["These were theirs."] = "这些曾是他们的。",
    ["The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain."] = "炎魔，四位元素领主之一，被束缚在元素位面，直到黑铁矮人在黑石山下将他召来。",
    ["The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."] = "这次召唤把山裂开，形成了熔火之心。",
    ["The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered."] = "守护者的法杖，已经断裂四散。",
    ["Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it."] = "重铸它，意味着从纳克萨玛斯收集四十块碎片，从克尔苏加德那里取来杖柄，再把它送到麦迪文曾经握着它的卡拉赞废墟。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade's chief scholar, who guards the Monastery library and its collection rather more aggressively than a librarian should."] = "血色十字军的首席学者，他看守修道院图书馆和藏书的方式，比一个图书管理员该有的凶得多。",
    ["The Soulflayer, a blood god the Atal'ai priests summoned into Zul'Gurub."] = "夺灵者，阿塔莱祭司召入祖尔格拉布的血神。",
    ["He feeds on the blood of his own worshippers, which is the part they had not planned for."] = "他以自己崇拜者的血为食，这一部分是他们没有料到的。",
    ["The Stromgarde Militia has placed bounties on the heads of Lord Falconcrest, and his bodyguard Otto."] = "激流堡民兵悬赏法库雷斯特公爵和他的保镖奥图。",
    ["Falconcrest heads the Syndicate's efforts in the Arathi Highlands, and his death would cause a major disruption in those efforts."] = "法库雷斯特主持辛迪加在阿拉希高地的行动，他的死会让那些行动大乱。",
    ["The Whirlwind Axe comes from an elemental trial a warrior has to complete alone."] = "旋风之斧来自一场战士必须独自完成的元素试炼。",
    ["Three weapons come from the same chain and you keep only one."] = "三件武器来自同一条任务链，你只能留下一件。",
    ["The black dragonflight's overseer in Lower Blackrock Spire, keeping the orcs there in line on Nefarian's behalf."] = "黑龙军团在黑石塔下层的监工，他替奈法利安管束那里的兽人。",
    ["The blade the Silver Hand carried against the Scourge, and the one Tirion Fordring's order was built around."] = "白银之手用来对抗天灾的那把剑，也是提里奥·弗丁的骑士团围绕着建立起来的那一把。",
    ["Corrupted when Renault Mograine used it on his own father, Alexandros, in the Scarlet Monastery."] = "雷诺·莫格莱尼在血色修道院用它砍向自己的父亲阿莱克斯时，它被腐蚀了。",
    ["The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on."] = "奈法利安三条幼龙中的最后一条，也是战斗越久就越生气的那一条。",
    ["The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."] = "其拉帝国最出色的士兵，她与荣誉卫队并肩作战，拒绝与他们分开。",
    ["The third of the qiraji council, who charges the moment the fight begins and does not stop."] = "其拉议会的第三人，战斗一开始就冲锋，而且不停。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength."] = "其拉的双子皇帝之一，继承了克苏恩的魔法天赋，而不是兄弟的力量。",
    ["Neither twin can be killed far from the other."] = "双胞胎谁也不能在离对方太远的地方被杀死。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair."] = "其拉的双子皇帝之一，也是这对兄弟里更有力的那只手臂。",
    ["Two extra attacks on a proc, on a fast axe."] = "触发时额外攻击两次，附在一把快速的斧上。",
    ["Warriors farmed Dire Maul for this one item and nothing else."] = "战士们刷厄运之槌，就为了这一件，别的都不要。",
    ["Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping."] = "通缉：阿纳克·恐怖图腾。流亡者阿纳克因谋杀与绑架的恶行被通缉。",
    ["Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."] = "丰厚的奖赏将给予那些有勇气将这名罪犯绳之以法的人。",
    ["Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn."] = "通缉：霍格。一只巨大的豺狼人霍格正在艾尔文西南的林子里游荡。",
    ["Wanted: Maggot Eye!"] = "通缉：蛆眼！",
    ["A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken."] = "即便以豺狼人的标准也十分肮脏的蛆眼，因对被遗忘者犯下的罪行被判处死刑。",
    ["This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."] = "这个可鄙的恶棍一直在偷尸体，供巫妖王的军队使用。",
    ["We mages do more than just waggle our fingers and make pretty sparks!"] = "我们法师可不是只会摆弄手指、变出漂亮火花！",
    ["We control magic, the base fabric of our world!"] = "我们掌控魔法，那是我们这个世界的基本织体！",
    ["And that takes great care, and resolve."] = "而这需要极大的小心和决心。",
    ["What is left of a green dragon who went into the Sunken Temple after the Nightmare and did not come out himself."] = "一条绿龙追着梦魇走进沉没的神庙，他自己没有出来，这是剩下的东西。",
    ["You have earned reverence among the Guard."] = "你在卫队中赢得了崇敬。",
    ["Present your insignia!"] = "呈上你的徽记！",
    ["You have earned the Eye of Command."] = "你赢得了命令之眼。",
    ["Present your insignia, Commander."] = "呈上你的徽记，指挥官。",
    ["For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike."] = "为此，你在雷矛中赢得了荣誉军阶。",
    ["Your radiate command and power, shaman."] = "你散发着统御与力量，萨满。",
    ["Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name."] = "在霜狼眼中你已是崇拜——敌人听到你的名字就会退缩。",
    ["Your time has come again."] = "你的时刻再次到来。",
    ["You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature."] = "你赢得了新的军阶，也就赢得了一枚标示这次晋升的新徽记。",
    ["A burst of energy fills the caster, increasing his damage by 10 and armor by 150 for 15 sec."] = "一股能量充满施法者，使伤害提高10点，护甲提高150点，持续15秒。",
    ["Attack all nearby enemies, dealing weapon damage plus 5 every 3 sec for 9 sec, and reducing your own movement speed by 80%."] = "攻击附近所有敌人，在9秒内每3秒造成武器伤害外加5点，并使你自己的移动速度降低80%。",
    ["Blast the target with the fires of a forge, inflicting 51 Fire damage."] = "以熔炉之火轰击目标，造成51点火焰伤害。",
    ["Blasts enemies in front of you with the power of wind, fire, all that kind of thing!"] = "以风、火，诸如此类的力量轰击你面前的敌人！",
    ["Blasts nearby enemies with thunder increasing the time between their attacks by 11% for 10 sec and doing 42 Nature damage to them. � Will affect up to 4 targets."] = "以雷霆轰击附近的敌人，使攻击间隔提高11%，持续10秒，并造成42点自然伤害。最多影响4个目标。",
    ["Blunderflame the target for 1 to 111 Fire damage."] = "对目标来一下误焰，造成1到111点火焰伤害。",
    ["Burns the enemy for 200 damage over 30 sec."] = "灼烧敌人，在30秒内造成200点伤害。",
    ["Burns the target for 33 Fire damage every 3 sec for 15 sec."] = "灼烧目标，在15秒内每3秒造成33点火焰伤害。",
    ["Concuss the target, slowing movement speed by 20% for 6 sec."] = "震击目标，使移动速度降低20%，持续6秒。",
    ["Cremate the target for 56 Fire damage."] = "焚化目标，造成56点火焰伤害。",
    ["Damage caused by the target is reduced by 5 for 2 min."] = "目标造成的伤害降低5点，持续2分钟。",
    ["Deal 294 Physical damage and stun for1.5 sec."] = "造成294点物理伤害，并击晕1.5秒。",
    ["Trolls take 2 times as much damage and stun duration."] = "巨魔受到的伤害和昏迷时间变为2倍。",
    ["Deal 84 Nature damage, increased by 2% per stack of Static Electricity."] = "造成84点自然伤害，每层静电提高2%。",
    ["Deals 14 Nature damage every 3 sec to any enemy in an 8 yard radius around the caster for 12 sec."] = "在12秒内，每3秒对施法者周围8码内的敌人造成14点自然伤害。",
    ["Decrease the armor of the target by 100 for 20 sec. � While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible."] = "使目标的护甲降低100点，持续20秒。效果期间，目标无法潜行或隐形。",
    ["Deals 50% increased damage to targets below 25% health."] = "对生命值低于25%的目标造成的伤害提高50%。",
    ["Discipline the target, dealing 91 Physical damage."] = "惩戒目标，造成91点物理伤害。",
    ["Canines and Hyenas are Stunned and sit for 3 sec."] = "犬类和土狼被击晕并坐下，持续3秒。",
    ["Diseases a target for 100 Nature damage and an additional 360 damage over 1 min."] = "使目标感染疾病，造成100点自然伤害，并在1分钟内额外造成360点伤害。",
    ["Disorients the target, causing it to wander aimlessly for up to 3 sec."] = "使目标迷惑，致其漫无目的地游荡，最多3秒。",
    ["Dispels a magic effect on the current foe."] = "驱散当前敌人身上的一个魔法效果。",
    ["Enemy is inflicted with the Bleakwood Curse that reduces their magic resistances by 25. � Can be applied up to 3 times."] = "敌人受到 Bleakwood Curse，魔法抗性降低25点。最多可叠加3次。",
    ["Fires a Shadow Shot at the target for 21 to 31 Shadow damage."] = "对目标射出暗影射击，造成21到31点暗影伤害。",
    ["Heal yourself for 270 to 450 and increase your Strength by 120 for 30 sec."] = "为自己恢复270到450点生命值，并使力量提高120点，持续30秒。",
    ["Heals the wielder for 182 damage over 14 sec."] = "在14秒内为持有者恢复182点生命值。",
    ["Hurl spikes at the target, dealing 45 Physical damage and jumping to 1 additional nearby enemy."] = "向目标投掷尖刺，造成45点物理伤害，并跳向附近额外1个敌人。",
    ["Each jump reduces the damage by 50%."] = "每次跳跃使伤害降低50%。",
    ["Ignite the target in the flames of the Great Forge, dealing 39 to 59 Holyfire damage."] = "以大锻炉的火焰点燃目标，造成39到59点神圣火焰伤害。",
    ["Increases your chance to Parry attacks by 2% for 9 sec."] = "使你招架攻击的几率提高2%，持续9秒。",
    ["Inflict 42 Fire and 14 Frost damage, slow the target by 50% for 5 sec, reduce armor by 50, and inflict 7 Nature damage every 3 sec for 12 sec."] = "造成42点火焰伤害和14点冰霜伤害，使目标减速50%，持续5秒，护甲降低50点，并在12秒内每3秒造成7点自然伤害。",
    ["Knocks down all nearby enemies for 3 sec."] = "击倒附近所有敌人，持续3秒。",
    ["Launch a magic severing bolt at the target, dealing 36 Physical damage and interrupting the spell being cast for 5 sec."] = "向目标射出一道切断魔法的箭，造成36点物理伤害，并打断正在施放的法术，持续5秒。",
    ["Lowers the Attack Power of the target by 40 for 1 min."] = "使目标的攻击强度降低40点，持续1分钟。",
    ["Protects the caster with a holy shield."] = "以神圣之盾保护施法者。",
    ["Pummel the target for 25 damage and interrupt the spell being cast for 5 sec."] = "拳击目标，造成25点伤害，并打断正在施放的法术，持续5秒。",
    ["Punctures target's armor, lowering it by 100."] = "刺穿目标的护甲，使其降低100点。",
    ["Reduce your threat to the current target making them less likely to attack you."] = "降低你对当前目标的威胁，使其不太会攻击你。",
    ["Reduces an enemy's armor by 165. � Stacks up to 3 times."] = "使一名敌人的护甲降低165点。最多叠加3次。",
    ["Reduces targets armor by 300 for 20 sec."] = "使目标的护甲降低300点，持续20秒。",
