    ["Melee attacks deal an additional 7 Fire damage for 30 sec."] = "近战攻击额外造成7点火焰伤害，持续30秒。",
    ["Page Everlook Emergency Services for a Parachute-Priest that will assist in healing allies for 15 sec."] = "呼叫永望镇紧急服务，召来一位降落伞牧师，协助治疗盟友，持续15秒。",
    ["Perform a Propellerstorm, reducing your fall speed for 15 sec and dealing 100% weapon damage to nearby enemies when you land."] = "施展一场螺旋桨风暴，使坠落速度降低，持续15秒，落地时对附近敌人造成100%的武器伤害。",
    ["Purifies the friendly target, removing 1 disease effect and 1 poison effect."] = "净化友方目标，移除1个疾病效果和1个中毒效果。",
