    ["Stuns target Undead for 6 sec."] = "击晕目标亡灵，持续6秒。",
    ["Stuns target Worgen for 4 sec."] = "击晕目标狼人，持续4秒。",
    ["Summons a tracking hound that will protect you for 3 min."] = "召唤一只追踪猎犬保护你，持续3分钟。",
    ["Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler."] = "削弱污染者拉瑟莱克的仆从。",
    ["Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."] = "必须靠近目标才能启动。",
    ["As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool."] = "我对阿鲁高魔法的理解越深，对这个倒霉傻瓜的鄙夷就越重。",
    ["I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."] = "我对他所谓疗法的研究就快完成了。",
    ["Edwin VanCleef must be assassinated."] = "必须暗杀艾德温·范克里夫。",
    ["While it saddens me to condemn any man to a death sentence, it is for the greater good of the people of Westfall that VanCleef is laid to rest once and for all."] = "判任何人死刑都让我难过，但为了西部荒野人民更大的利益，范克里夫必须被彻底解决。",
    ["Here is the final challenge that I will put forth."] = "这是我要提出的最后一项挑战。",
    ["We've been tracking an elusive tiger for weeks."] = "我们已经追踪一只难以捉摸的老虎好几周了。",
    ["I draw my power - my will to continue living and breathing - from the unmitigated hatred I have for the Scourge and all that they have done."] = "我的力量，我继续活着、继续呼吸的意志，都来自我对天灾及其所作所为毫不掩饰的憎恨。",
    ["I must warn you, this matter must stay between us."] = "我必须警告你，这件事只能留在我们之间。",
    ["The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."] = "萨特已经够让我们丢脸了，而这个又离家园太近。",
    ["Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands."] = "勘察员维尔加现在把他在湿地工地上的原始化石拿在手里。",
    ["When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."] = "当我发现雷鲁之石时，我相信它是解开化石之谜的钥匙。",
    ["So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus?"] = "所以勘察员想把那块神秘的化石送到达纳苏斯的探险者协会？",
    ["I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."] = "把他留在这里、自己离开黑海岸，我觉得不对。",
    ["Strength has left me."] = "力量离开了我。",
    ["Your help is needed!"] = "需要你的帮助！",
    ["Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune."] = "很久以前，这里是艾露恩的一座大神殿。",
    ["But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."] = "但不幸导致了毁灭：一位上古之神的腐蚀从地下渗出，玷污了神圣的月井。",
    ["This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan."] = "不能让这个暮光之锤的追随者完成他的计划。",
    ["The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature."] = "暮光之锤不理解自然的灵魂。",
    ["They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."] = "他们信仰上古之神——那些很久以前就被击败的混乱与毁灭之物。",
    ["This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream."] = "这块碎片藏着巨大的秘密；它是翡翠梦境的纯粹精华。",
    ["However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."] = "然而，我在这块碎片里看见的不是梦；这样的景象，人们会称之为噩梦。",
    ["We believe they are hiding out in the Dagger Hills, plotting their next move."] = "我们相信他们藏在 Dagger Hills，正在策划下一步。",
    ["Slay the wretches in the name of The People's Militia."] = "以人民军的名义杀死这些恶棍。",
    ["While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."] = "我在去见维尔加的路上遭到迅猛龙袭击，圣物丢了。",
    ["(be aware that some vendors sell items at random)"] = "（注意，有些商人随机出售物品）",
    ["Bought from Rune Broker in Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Elwynn Forest, Dun Morogh, and Teldrassil."] = "购自暴风城、铁炉堡、达纳苏斯、艾尔文森林、丹莫罗和泰达希尔的 Rune Broker。",
    ["Bought from Rune Broker in Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Undercity, Durotar, Mulgore, and Tirisfal Glades."] = "购自奥格瑞玛、雷霆崖、幽暗城、杜隆塔尔、莫高雷和提瑞斯法林地的 Rune Broker。",
    ["Bought from Rune Broker in Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Elwynn Forest, Dun Morogh, and Teldrassil, and in Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Undercity, Durotar, Mulgore, and Tirisfal Glades."] = "购自暴风城、铁炉堡、达纳苏斯、艾尔文森林、丹莫罗和泰达希尔，以及奥格瑞玛、雷霆崖、幽暗城、杜隆塔尔、莫高雷和提瑞斯法林地的 Rune Broker。",
    ["Found in a container."] = "可在容器中找到。",
    ["The belt is crafted afterwards."] = "腰带是在那之后制作的。",
