    ["Collect 4 pieces for the heal and mana, and all 5 for Dream Venom."] = "为了治疗和法力收集4件，为了梦境毒素则要集齐全部5件。",
    ["Collect 4 pieces for the heal and mana."] = "为了治疗和法力收集4件。",
    ["Provided item:."] = "提供的物品：",
